1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:12,030
What did the team find?
这支队伍找到了什么？

2
00:00:12,030 --> 00:00:13,780
What did the team find?
这支队伍找到了什么？

3
00:00:16,390 --> 00:00:20,760
Dreams of finding lost treasure almost came true recently.
最近，寻找失踪宝藏的梦想几乎变成了现实。

4
00:00:21,660 --> 00:00:26,290
A new machine called 'The Revealer' has been invented
人们发明了一种叫“探宝器”的新机器，

5
00:00:26,310 --> 00:00:31,800
and it has been used to detect gold which has been buried in the ground.
它被用来探测埋在地下的金子。

6
00:00:32,780 --> 00:00:41,290
The machine was used in a cave near the seashore where --it is said--pirates used to hide gold.
这台机器被用在海边的一个山洞里——据说海盗过去常把金子藏在那里。

7
00:00:42,380 --> 00:00:48,090
The pirates would often bury gold in the cave and then fail to collect it.
海盗们常把金子埋在洞里，然后又没能取走。

8
00:00:49,460 --> 00:00:56,910
Armed with the new machine, a search party went into the cave hoping to find buried treasure.
一支配备了这种新机器的搜索队进了山洞，希望能找到埋藏的财宝。

9
00:00:58,120 --> 00:01:07,790
The leader of the party was examining the soil near the entrance to the cave when the machine showed that there was gold under the ground.
队长正在检查洞口附近的泥土，这时机器显示地下有金子。

10
00:01:08,900 --> 00:01:13,790
Very excited, the party dug a hole two feet deep.
大家非常激动，挖了一个两英尺深的洞。

11
00:01:15,300 --> 00:01:19,630
They finally found a small gold coin which was almost worthless.
他们终于找到了一枚几乎一文不值的小金币。

12
00:01:21,040 --> 00:01:26,970
The party then searched the whole cave thoroughly but did not find anything
搜索队随后把整个山洞彻底搜了一遍，除了

13
00:01:26,990 --> 00:01:28,870
except an empty tin trunk.
一个空的铁皮箱子什么也没找到。

14
00:01:29,600 --> 00:01:33,650
In spite of this, many people are confident that
尽管如此，许多人还是相信

15
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:38,170
'The Revealer' may reveal something of value fairly soon.
“探宝器”很快就会探测出有价值的东西。
